  "details": "After many SDK updates, there is still odd problem / bug there in SDK: the world size detection sometimes confuse between Windows and Android mode.\n\nIt happens me sometimes SDK thinks i have Android mode and will tell me my world size is too big, over 100MB. But i am still in Windows mode.\n\nHow the heck is this detection bug still there after many SDK releases? Because it doesn't always happens there for many players. The bug will only happens if you work long time in project, and want upload it... you might get weird red warning your world is too big.\n\nRestart Unity is not big problem, but it's still weird bug and should fixed. I am sure i did in past time some reports, but it's still not fixed today.",
